Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.77,0:00:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.33,0:00:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.33,0:00:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.97,0:00:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.37,0:00:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.19,0:00:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.11,0:00:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.02,0:00:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.93,0:00:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.45,0:00:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.49,0:01:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This museum's gotta have some clues\Nto help the spirit remember his past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.31,0:01:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sure you want to go\Nthrough with this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.53,0:01:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no choice, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.01,0:01:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.13,0:01:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.45,0:01:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense something in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.53,0:01:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,In the basement?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.33,0:01:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a part of the exhibit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.83,0:01:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Something down there is\Ncalling out to me, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.15,0:01:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel that the answers I seek are near.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.05,0:01:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.73,0:01:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of ancient Egyptian stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.63,0:01:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And those carvings resemble\Ndual monster cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.05,0:01:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.57,0:01:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy looks just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.69,0:01:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this thing for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.85,0:02:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.45,0:02:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Taya, it is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.87,0:02:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow I know it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.71,0:02:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And look, around his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.85,0:02:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.91,0:02:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That appears to be me playing an\Nancient form of duel monsters. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.49,0:02:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exactly the kind of\Nclue I've been searching for.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.43,0:02:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but I wish I were able\Nto decipher its meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who am I dueling against in this carving?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.23,0:02:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What was this age-old game all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.13,0:02:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it even a game? Hmm, just\Nwhen I think I found one answer, a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.59,0:02:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thousand new questions arise. I've
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.35,0:02:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,been expecting you who are you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.03,0:02:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I am ishizu and I have uncovered\Nmany mysteries about you and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.45,0:02:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,these ancient carvings using the\Nmagic of My Millennium Necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Another Millennium Item.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.81,0:03:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Like your Millennium Puzzle, this\Nnecklace affords me certain powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.53,0:03:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,With it, I have gazed\N5,000 years into the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,to a time when evil sorcerers\Nthreatened to destroy the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.11,0:03:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,there was one king who possessed a magic\Npowerful enough to stop this evil threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.97,0:03:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And who was this king?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.73,0:03:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh who saved\Nthe world was you, Yami.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.01,0:03:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And now the time has come for\Nyou to rescue mankind once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.63,0:03:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,To rescue mankind from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.99,0:03:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know the world is in\Ndanger of being destroyed again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Necklace also\Nshows me visions of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.03,0:03:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.85,0:03:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The events of the past\Nwill occur once again,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.89,0:03:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and that same great evil\Nwill return to threaten us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.43,0:03:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How will I recognize this evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.67,0:03:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that your memory has faded, my\Npharaoh, and that you seek many answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I also know a Duel Monsters\Ntournament is beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:03:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you win it, you will find your answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.45,0:04:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,When you return home, you'll discover\Nan invitation waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.43,0:04:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, King Yami.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yami?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.89,0:04:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.91,0:04:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, and you were this powerful Egyptian\Nking who saved the world 5,000 years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.99,0:04:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pretty major. Yes, but\NI still have so many questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, my opponent looks like\NKaiba. You're right, but wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.03,0:04:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,that would mean that he was the\Nancient evil sorcerer Could it be
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.11,0:04:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,that I'm supposed to face Kaiba\Nin order to save the world again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.95,0:04:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's only one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.81,0:04:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to win that tournament!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.47,0:04:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All hands, stand by for the final\Ntest of the new dual disk system.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.55,0:05:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,As you requested, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.01,0:05:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, we've removed all\Nsafeguards from the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crazy if you go\Nthrough with this, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.99,0:05:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If the safeguards are turned off, the\Nmonsters in this duel could really hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.91,0:05:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough whining. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.87,0:05:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I invented this new dual disc system,\Nand I'll be the one to test it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to make sure the KaibaCorp satellite\Ntracking system is working perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.55,0:05:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It traces all KaibaCorp duel discs,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.85,0:05:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,allowing me to keep an eye on\Nevery duel in the tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.55,0:05:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can't afford any screw-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But more importantly, I want to test\Nthe power of my new Egyptian God card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.73,0:05:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm going to use it to\Ndestroy Yugi and reclaim my
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.43,0:05:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,rightful title as number one\Nduelist in the entire world,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.79,0:05:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to make absolutely sure\Nit's as powerful as Ishizu claims.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.59,0:05:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,She may have bored me with her\Nhocus-pocus nonsense about the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.89,0:05:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but she was right about one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.43,0:06:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi and I will face each other again, and\Nthis time with a deck full of rare cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.63,0:06:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.43,0:06:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The dual disc is online.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.95,0:06:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Engaging dual robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.91,0:06:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We've updated the dual robot's hard\Ndrive with your latest tournament rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.57,0:06:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm setting skill level at max.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.87,0:06:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ready to begin on your command.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.79,0:06:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, are you sure you want\Nto go through with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the medics on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.03,0:06:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Probability of injury, 90%.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.85,0:06:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, why don't you keep\Nyour calculations to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.49,0:06:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just doing my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.97,0:06:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the robot is armed\Nwith the exact same deck Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.79,0:06:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba used at Duelist Kingdom,\Nrisk of injury is high.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You put all three Blue-Eyes White\NDragons in the Duel Robots deck? Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:06:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.36,0:06:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's direct orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto's in major trouble if he\Ngets attacked by a Blue-Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.93,0:07:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope he knows what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.11,0:07:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Beware, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.53,0:07:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk may be too powerful\Nfor you to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.63,0:07:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Powerful, huh? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.99,0:07:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way I'll know\Nhow strong an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.93,0:07:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,god card is until I see\Nit with my own two eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And the best test of\NObelisk the Tormenter's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.39,0:07:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,strength is against the might of not one,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but three of the most powerful\Ndragons in all of Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.89,0:07:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-on-one may seem unfair,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.29,0:07:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but if Egyptian god cards are\Nas powerful as Ishizu claims,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.87,0:07:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,obelisks should destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.87,0:07:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Switching on the main computer's\Nauto-dual system. Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.33,0:07:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Dual robot standing by. Engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.59,0:07:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Launching hologram projectors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.79,0:08:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,With my new portable projectors, there's\Nno need for oversized dueling arenas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.37,0:08:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.03,0:08:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Draw a card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Accessing duel database\Nfor optimal battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Set monster card in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.23,0:08:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play this card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.51,0:08:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I summon the mighty Battle Ox.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.67,0:08:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy his monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.89,0:08:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Axe Slam Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.15,0:08:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Cyber Jar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.59,0:08:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster, Cyber Jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.73,0:08:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Special Effect 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.09,0:08:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy all monsters on field.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.57,0:09:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyber Jar Special Effect 2. Each player\Nsummons up to 5 monsters onto field.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.59,0:09:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Set 2 monsters onto field
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.39,0:09:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I place 4 monsters on the field
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.83,0:09:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What a digital dummy! The\Nrobot gave Seto a huge lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.95,0:09:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Analyzing new tournament\Nrules. Must sacrifice two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.97,0:09:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters to summon Blue\NEyes White Dragon What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.71,0:09:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm in trouble Turn off\Nthe machine before he gets hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.77,0:09:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Duel Robot already\Nmastered my new sacrifice
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.07,0:09:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,rule to summon the Blue-Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.79,0:09:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If it attacks now, it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.91,0:10:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Opponent has card face down. End turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.09,0:10:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The Duel Robot didn't attack\Nbecause it thinks my face down
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.79,0:10:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,card is a trap intended to destroy\Nthe Blue-Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.05,0:10:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.39,0:10:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice a monster\Nto summon Dragon Seeker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.49,0:10:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,In defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.71,0:10:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon Seeker's special effect\Nallows it to destroy one
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.09,0:10:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,dragon instantly when it switches\Nfrom defense to attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.89,0:10:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,On my next turn, that\Nblue eyes is history.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.05,0:10:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Analyzing Dragon Seeker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.19,0:10:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Processing countermeasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Set one card face down on field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.59,0:10:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon Lord of Dragons\Nin attack mode. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.37,0:10:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord of Dragons special effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.05,0:10:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Protects dragons from all\Nmagic, trap, and monster cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.87,0:11:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon Seeker's effect negated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.33,0:11:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't destroy the Blue Eyes White\NDragon, at least I can protect myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.09,0:11:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I switch all my monsters to defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.31,0:11:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't lose, Seto. Do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.57,0:11:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Processing battle strategy, playing\Nmagic card Flute of Summoning Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.19,0:11:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,magic effect summons two dragons from\Nhand onto field selecting dragons
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.85,0:11:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,processing summon two blue eyes\Nwhite dragons there's no way Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.77,0:11:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Three blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.43,0:11:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Playing magic card polymerization.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.65,0:11:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuse three blue eyes into\Nblue eyes ultimate dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.05,0:11:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Analyzing Tournament Rulebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.07,0:12:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Fusion Monster cannot attack\Non same turn it was created.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.79,0:12:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Must end turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.91,0:12:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.91,0:12:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto! He's doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.67,0:12:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,None of his monsters come even remotely\Nclose to the dragon's attack strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.07,0:12:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The damage from Ultimate Dragon's\Nattack will be catastrophic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.65,0:12:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With the safeties disabled,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.95,0:12:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,the dragon's neutron blast will\Ncause serious injury to Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.31,0:12:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.47,0:12:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of there, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.29,0:12:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut down the duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.05,0:12:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.69,0:12:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is what it's like to face fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.49,0:12:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be how Yugi felt\Nwhen he stared into the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.03,0:12:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,eyes of my Blue-Eyes Ultimate\NDragon at Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.57,0:13:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He came close to bringing my\Npowerful beast to its doom,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.31,0:13:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but in the end, even Yugi couldn't\Ndefeat the Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon. So,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.89,0:13:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,if I'm to reclaim my title as\Nthe greatest duelist in history,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.57,0:13:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I must beat the monster that\Neven Yugi couldn't defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.55,0:13:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to face the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.97,0:13:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for my final test.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.53,0:13:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll see what an\NEgyptian god card can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.19,0:13:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.83,0:13:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon you by sacrificing\Nthree of my monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.87,0:14:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.35,0:14:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That Egyptian god card is humongous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.17,0:14:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormentor, let's\Nsee how powerful you really are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I offer you my two remaining monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.71,0:14:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Absorb their power to increase your own
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.09,0:14:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything\Nlike this Obelisk's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.77,0:14:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,attack points are climbing off the charts
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.97,0:14:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.88,0:14:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,attack now Show Blue Eye's ultimate\Ndragon Why you're known as the Tormentor
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.57,0:14:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk, fist of fate
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.91,0:14:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,System error. System error.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.17,0:14:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Power overload. Danger. Danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.11,0:15:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The computer's exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.55,0:15:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut down the power source right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.99,0:15:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormenter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He defeated Ultimate\NDragon with a single punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.29,0:15:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.63,0:15:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is the power of one card,\Nwith all three Egyptian God cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.53,0:15:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be unstoppable!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.51,0:15:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defeat Yugi and reclaim my\Ntitle as the number one duelist!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.57,0:15:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The invitations at the tournament\Nwould be announced tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.55,0:15:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if everything she\Nsaid is true, but I do know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.17,0:15:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I must enter and win this tournament\Nin order to fulfill my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.61,0:15:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just promise me you'll be careful, Yami,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.27,0:15:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,because I'm sure there's\Nstill danger ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.91,0:16:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, whoever's after the Millennium\NPuzzle is still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.57,0:16:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But you must trust me, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.79,0:16:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This deck has never let me down before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.51,0:16:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Yugi and I stay\Nconnected to one another,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.79,0:16:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I am confident that we can use\Nthis deck to win this tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.87,0:16:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,unlock the mysteries of my ancient\Npast, and realize our destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.77,0:16:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can count on my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.67,0:16:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.09,0:16:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.03,0:16:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Taya, it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.45,0:16:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugi, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.61,0:16:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my valentine. Oh, joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.87,0:16:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you guys missed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.41,0:16:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's such a shame we\Ndon't hang out more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.23,0:16:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.99,0:16:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking snazzy,\NTaya. Is this a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.93,0:16:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just friends, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.39,0:17:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume you've come\Nhere for the tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.91,0:17:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.51,0:17:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I presume you got an invitation also?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.29,0:17:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did, but it didn't\Nsay who it was from.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.01,0:17:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know who's hosting this tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.79,0:17:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea. It's a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.81,0:17:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody seems to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.31,0:17:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone I spoke to got\Nan anonymous invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.01,0:17:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is a buzz going\Naround that it's someone
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.63,0:17:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,with a ton of cash and\Nan obnoxious attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.65,0:17:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd guess Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.85,0:17:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be why Ishizu told me to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.83,0:17:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If the events of the past are to happen\Nagain, I must face Kaiba in this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.39,0:17:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you mumbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.15,0:17:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, nobody knows for sure who\Nit is that's throwing this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.21,0:17:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose we'll find out soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.05,0:17:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty safe to say\Nit's not Pegasus again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.87,0:17:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of Pegasus, this is beginning to\Nlook like Duelist Kingdom all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.85,0:17:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You can say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.19,0:17:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There certainly are a lot of\Nfamiliar faces in this crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.99,0:17:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of whom I'm not too happy to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.17,0:18:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.09,0:18:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Weevil Underwood and Rex Raptor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.83,0:18:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And over there's Esperoba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.11,0:18:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They say he uses psychic powers to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.01,0:18:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And Mako's here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.39,0:18:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If what Mai said earlier is correct,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.63,0:18:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,then this tournament is going\Nto have one new wrinkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.15,0:18:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And there he is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.49,0:18:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.53,0:18:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.17,0:18:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the town of Domino.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.29,0:18:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But more importantly,\Nwelcome to my tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know which is bigger, his\Nego or his melon on the big screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.27,0:18:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hear what Kaiba has to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.71,0:18:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you each received\Nyour private invite to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.73,0:18:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Corp's very exclusive\NDuel Monsters Tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.09,0:18:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and you had enough brains\Nto show up here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.27,0:18:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.87,0:18:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Being that you are all elite duelists,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.91,0:18:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've added special rules to my\Ntournament just for experts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.13,0:19:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, you will duel using\Nthese new improved duel discs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.11,0:19:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Check that out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.23,0:19:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, that Kaiba Corp's\Ngot the coolest products!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.99,0:19:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Another new rule that I designed for\Nthe tournament is that before each duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.71,0:19:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,both players must ante\Nup their rarest card,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.47,0:19:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and the loser of the duel\Nforfeits his card to the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.97,0:19:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Forfeit my Dark Magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.89,0:19:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That means losing even\None duel can ruin my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.61,0:19:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My competition will make Pegasus and his
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.79,0:19:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Duelist Kingdom tournament\Nlook like a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.55,0:19:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, it's not you, Kaiba! You're cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.03,0:19:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.17,0:19:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.69,0:19:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd come, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.05,0:19:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see which one of us\Nis the number one duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.45,0:19:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to register and\Npick up your dual disc Because
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.95,0:19:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,exactly one week from today My\NBattle City tournament begins
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.01,0:20:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.35,0:20:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle City, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.49,0:20:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That is correct,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.59,0:20:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Master The world's most elite duelists\Nhave assembled for this tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.27,0:20:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How very convenient for\Nus that so many of our
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.73,0:20:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,targets have gathered\Ntogether in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.89,0:20:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my rare hunters, go to the\Ntown of Domino at once! Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.03,0:20:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to begin the hunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.93,0:20:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Domino!
